{title: Koi Jab Tumhara Hriday Tod De}
{artist: Mukesh Kalyanji Anandji}
{key: A#}

{c: Verse 1}
[A#]Koi jab tumhara hri [F#]day tod [A#]de,        [A#]Tadapta hua jab [D#m]koi chhod [A#]de
[G#]Tab tum mere paas [A#m]aana priye,        [A#m]Meraa dar khulaa hai,
[G#]Khula hi rahega [A#m]tumhare [A#]liye,        [A#]Koi jab tumhara hri [F#]day tod [A#]de
[A#]Abhi tum ko [D#]meri [A#]jarurat nahi,        [F#]Bahot chaahanewaale [A#]mil jaayenge
[A#]Abhi rup [D#]ka ek [A#]saagar ho tum,        [F#]Kanwal jitne chaahogi [A#]khil jayenge
[A#]Darpan tumhe jab [F#]darane [A#]lage,        [A#]Jawani bhi daman [D#m]chhudane [A#]lage
[G#]Tab tum mere paas [A#m]aanaa pirye,        [A#m]Meraa sar zukaa hai,
[G#]Zukaa hai rahega [A#m]tumhaare [A#]liye,        [A#]Koi jab tumhara hri [F#]day tod [A#]de
[A#]Tadapta hua jab [D#m]koi chhod [A#]de,        [A#]Koi sharta [D#]hoti [A#]nahin pyaar me
[F#]Magar pyaar sharton pe [A#]tum ne kiya,        [A#]Nazar me [D#]sitare [A#]jo chamake jara
[F#]Buzaane lagi aa [A#]rati kaa diyaa,        [A#]Jab apani nazar me hi [F#]girne [A#]lago
[A#]Andhero me apane hi [D#m]ghirane [A#]lago,        [G#]Tab tum mere paas [A#m]aanaa pirye
[A#m]Yeh dipak jalaa hai,        [G#]Jalaa hi rahegaa [A#m]tumhaare [A#]liye
[A#]Koi jab tumhara hri [F#]day tod [A#]de,        [A#]Tadapta hua jab [D#m]koi chhod [A#]de
